We are all speaking together.
Suddenly I hear a noise.
A dog barks very loudly.
"Who is that?" I ask.
My father laughs.
He lifts Lola in front of the camera.
She is the family dog.
Lola sees me and barks.
"Hello, Lola," I say.
I laugh.
I take the laptop.
I turn the laptop around.
"Look, Lola," I say.
"This is my flat."
Lola looks at the screen.
"Here is a table and there is my chair."
My mother smiles.
"Your flat is really nice," she says.
"Thank you, Mama," I answer.
I am very happy.
